#: org.rolisteam.rolisteam.appdata.xml:8
#. (itstool) path: description/p
msgid ""
"This is the Rolisteam Client Binary which can be used either standalone as "
"a server/client or connect to a Roliserver instance (currently a docker "
"image)"
msgstr ""
"इदं Rolisteam Client Binary अस्ति यस्य उपयोगः सर्वर/क्लायन्ट् इत्यस्य रूपेण "
"स्वतन्त्रः अथवा Roliserver उदाहरणेन सह सम्बद्धं कर्तुं शक्यते (वर्तमानं "
"docker छवि) ।"